5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I worry about the ground shifting under the diggers. We need to know what the soil can actually handle.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,The park is a living system. I want to see how people actually move through it on a normal day.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,Who is going to mow the grass and fix the fences? I am worried about the daily work.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,Pretty drawings lie. I want to see what the last projects look like after five years of rain.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I am quiet, but I count the coins. I need to know the long-term cost of keeping this place alive.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, do you think the paths will hold up if the ground is soft?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, only if we respect the drainage. I am checking the crossing patterns to see where the pressure is.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,I am looking at the staff list. It feels like there are fewer people to do the work now.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I am reviewing the condition of the old works. If the apron cracked, the new one might too.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I am reading the upkeep ledgers. The numbers from three years ago look very different from today.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I am checking which firms are still willing to dig here. It seems like a risky job.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I am looking at the heat readings and drainage calls. The ground gets hot and wet, and that matters.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I am asking about the volunteer groups. Maybe they can help with the small tasks?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,"I am looking at the planting records. If the trees died before, we need to know why.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I am checking the terms of the funding. It seems the money has strict rules about what it can buy.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,Let us see what the ground tells us.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Logic over aesthetics. Let us look at the data.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minato,,I hope we find a plan that is easy to care for.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Minako,,Facts will guide us. Let us proceed.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will keep the ledger open.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
