35,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Only two firms are bidding, and they both warned about clay slippage. The south can be hoarded, but the center cannot.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The counts show people stick to hard ground. The heat readings are high, and drainage calls have doubled. The site is stressed.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,The staff roll is down to seven. But there are two volunteer groups already helping with habitat and youth sports.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The old basin is fine, but the civic hall apron has been patched three times. Half the avenue trees died from lack of water.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The habitat fund only pays for planting and water, not buildings. And upkeep for planted ground is triple the cost of hard surfaces.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Minako, if the trees died from neglect, does that mean we can't trust the planting plans?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, the slippage risk is real. We need a plan that doesn't fight the ground.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Jonathan, if upkeep is triple, that is a lot of money. But the volunteers might help with the basic care.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, the drainage issue is serious. We need something that handles water well, not just looks good.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minato, volunteers are great, but they don't pay for specialist water care. The ledger is the truth.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Kenji,,The phasing notes say we can keep the park open if we work in stages. That is good for the community.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,The heat and drainage data suggest we need more green space to cool the area and absorb rain.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,The volunteer groups are already there. It feels like a natural fit for a plan that uses them.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Minako,,The condition of the old works shows that hard surfaces fail. The basin survived because it was designed for water.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,The funding terms are strict. We can only build what the fund allows. That limits our options significantly.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"I am leaning towards a plan that works with the ground, not against it.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,The data points to a need for better drainage and cooling.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,I like the idea of using the volunteers. It feels right.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Minako,,I am convinced that water management is key.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I am concerned about the long-term cost, but the funding terms are clear.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
