60,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"Candidate A, Wetland Restoration, fits the drainage needs and the funding terms. It uses the water, not fights it.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,A addresses the heat and drainage issues directly. It is the logical choice based on the data.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minato,,"A involves habitat tasks, which the volunteer group already does. It seems like a good match for the people here.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Minako,,A is the only plan that aligns with the successful basin design. It is robust and long-lasting.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"A is funded by the habitat fund. While upkeep is higher, the capital cost is covered. It is the only viable option financially.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Minako, do you agree that A is the most durable option?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, yes. The data supports it. B and D would fail the drainage test.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@Jonathan, is the upkeep cost really that high? I hope the volunteers can help.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Minato, the volunteers help, but the specialist care is bought in. It is a cost, but a necessary one.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minato, it is high, but the fund covers the capital. We must accept the ongoing cost for a working system.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I am voting for A. It respects the ground and the community.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,I am voting for A. It is the only plan that makes sense with the data.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minato,,I am voting for A. It feels like the right choice for the people and the place.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Minako,,I am voting for A. It is the most resilient and well-designed option.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,I am voting for A. It is the only plan that fits the funding and the long-term reality.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Kenji,,Let us move forward with A.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Minato,,I am happy with this choice.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Minako,,A is the clear winner.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I will monitor the ledger, but A is the right path.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
